        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: One Magic Christmas, Muppet Treasure Island, Santa Claus in film, Life Begins at Eight-thirty, The Christmas That Almost Wasn't, Trading Places, I'll Be Home for Christmas, Elf\n- People: Phillip Borsos, Robert Louis Stevenson, Monty Woolley, Alberto Rabagliati, Dan Aykroyd, Jan Rubes, David Huddleston, Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Ed Asner\n- Topics: Santa Claus portrayals in film\n\nFacts:\n- One Magic Christmas is a 1985 American/Canadian Christmas fantasy film directed by Phillip Borsos.\n- Jan Rubes played Santa Claus in One Magic Christmas in 1985.\n- David Huddleston played Santa Claus in a 1985 film whose title is blank in the source sentence.\n- Muppet Treasure Island is a 1996 American musical adventure comedy film based on Robert Louis Stevenson's Treasure Island.\n- Monty Woolley played Santa Claus in Life Begins at Eight-thirty in 1942.\n- Alberto Rabagliati played Santa Claus in The Christmas That Almost Wasn't in 1966.\n- Dan Aykroyd played Santa Claus in Trading Places in 1983.\n- Jonathan Taylor Thomas played Santa Claus in I'll Be Home for Christmas in 1998.\n- Ed Asner played Santa Claus in Elf in 2003.",
